  "item_short_desc": "<p>Discover Rothco&rsquo;s Lightweight Concealed Carry Jacket, a versatile 3-season jacket with ambidextrous concealed pockets and inner gear pouches. Stylish and functional, it's perfect for those who prioritize both fashion and functionality.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
