  "description": "<p>Discover Rothco&rsquo;s Lightweight Concealed Carry Jacket, a versatile 3-season jacket with ambidextrous concealed pockets and inner gear pouches. Stylish and functional, it's perfect for those who prioritize both fashion and functionality.&nbsp;Tactical Pockets: Access Your Gear From Either Side For Quick And Discreet Retrieval.&nbsp;Inner Gear Pouches: Four Hook And Loop Pouches Keep Your EDC Essentials Organized And Easily Accessible.&nbsp;Tricot-Lined Zipper Pockets: Stay Warm With Two Tricot-Lined Front Zipper Pockets For Added Comfort And Storage.&nbsp;Quick Access With Two-Way Zipper: Sturdy Brass Zipper Allows Quick Access To Your Gear When Needed.&nbsp;Adjustable Fit: Lightweight And Durable, The Jacket Features Button Adjustment Waist Straps For A Perfect And Comfortable Fit.</p>",
